Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Helios — let your capital trade itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,An autonomous, self-custody trading agent\Non BNB Chain. You choose what it optimizes for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's built to survive markets,\Nnot just predict them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Deterministic decisions — not an LLM gambling.\N+8.4% in backtests while the market fell 22%.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Powered by CoinMarketCap, Trust Wallet, and BNB Chain.\NYour agent. Your rules. On-chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Every trade is cleared by an isolated risk engine —\Ndrawdown breaker, exposure caps, slippage, kill-switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Self-custody: connect your own wallet.\NKeys never leave you; funds can only return to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set your risk rules with simple sliders —\Nexposure, drawdown stop, trade size, cooldown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fund the agent wallet, then launch.\NWithdraw anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A live dashboard — price candles, equity curve,\Npositions, and every decision in real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch it run live on mainnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It reads CoinMarketCap and ranks\Nevery token by conviction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It buys only the strongest signal — UNI —\Napproved by the risk engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:02:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The swap is signed from your wallet\Nand confirmed on BNB Chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The decision and risk policy are written\Non-chain to an ERC-8004 identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't trust it — verify it on BscScan.\NDeterministic. Self-custody. Proven on-chain.
